        <span class="badge push-quarter--bottom">News Release</span>
    <h1 class="tera push-half--bottom">Argentina to peak at 180 Mmcd, becoming regional gas supplier and LNG exporter, says Wood Mackenzie</h1>
    <p class="mega push-half--bottom">Unconventional resources are set to drive Argentina&#x2019;s energy transformation</p>

    <div class="wrap relative" style="padding-left: 0 !important;">
            <div class="pull-left--medium">
                <time class="beta inline">07 July 2025</time>
                    <p class="read-time" data-words="546"><span>2 minute read</span></p>
            </div>

        <div class="pull-right--medium push-top--small">
                <ul>
                    <li class="list__item-inline">
                        <!-- LinkedIn -->
                        <button class="block share-icon" onclick="shareOnLinkedIn();">
